[Fact:VersionDifferences:48K/128K version differences]
<ul>
<li>48K version is a multiloader</li>
<li>128K version has AY music with sampled speech and effects</li>
<li>128K has a logo animation, then music plays, then attract mode cycle (48K version only has attract mode)</li>
<li>128K has a Best Officers (high score) on attract screen and a high score entry screen</li>
<li>128K retains the input device/define keys code (48K has to overwrite it for space reasons)</li>
<li>48K has a beatbox music routine on the input selection screen</li>
</ul>

[Fact:Secrets:Secrets]
Redefine keys to "SHOCKED&lt;ENTER&gt;" to activate test/cheat mode.

[Page:Bugs]
SectionPrefix=Bug

[Bug:TimeBonus:Time bonus uses wrong random value]
Bugfix provided by Russell Marks:

<p>When you finish a stage, a hidden bonus is sometimes given randomly. At
address $8b3d, instructions EX AF,AF' and LD B,A are in the wrong order.
Therefore calculation of time bonus is using random value from A' instead of
low digit from remaining time. Fixed with POKE 35645,71: POKE 35646,8.
